    "ix.29": "No logins, no accounts — every page runs in the browser. Student writing and products live on paper or in tools your district already vets.",
    "ix.30": "⚠️ <b>Honest history:</b> this unit teaches the violence used against nonviolent protesters — police dogs, fire hoses, mass arrests, and the 16th Street Baptist Church bombing that killed four girls — directly, factually, and with dignity (TEC §28.0022). The segregationist official's role is presented as a documented historical position, not an endorsement.",
    "ix.31": "▶ Start Phase 1 — Surface",
